  ('ai:ai-batch-03:83a752dcae62','A1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Look at the flag of Scotland. What colour is the cross?',array['white','green','red','yellow']::text[],'A','The flag of Scotland, the cross of St Andrew, is a white diagonal cross on a blue background.',array['britain','picture']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-03',null,'image','samples/flag_scotland.png','The flag of Scotland','practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-03:f1d08f01b8f5','A1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Watch the video. What is the date of Bonfire Night?',array['23 April','5 November','30 November','1 March']::text[],'B','The video shows Bonfire Night on 5 November.',array['britain','video']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-03',null,'video','samples/uk_calendar.mp4','Special days in the UK','practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-03:8503c4aaf565','A2'::public.cefr_level,'reading','When is Bonfire Night?',array['on 25 December','on 31 October','on 5 November','on 1 March']::text[],'C','''Bonfire Night is on 5 November.''',array['britain','story','history']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-03','Bonfire Night is on 5 November. It remembers an event in 1605. A group of Catholics, led by Guy Fawkes, planned to kill the Protestant king with a bomb in the Houses of Parliament. Their plan failed. Today people in Great Britain light bonfires and set off fireworks at home or at big public displays.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-03:1c8ce46f36a4','A2'::public.cefr_level,'reading','In the Bonfire Night story, who was Guy Fawkes?',array['the leader of the plotters','the Protestant king','a famous firework maker','a soldier who saved Parliament']::text[],'A','''A group of Catholics, led by Guy Fawkes, planned to kill the Protestant king.''',array['britain','story','history']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-03','Bonfire Night is on 5 November. It remembers an event in 1605. A group of Catholics, led by Guy Fawkes, planned to kill the Protestant king with a bomb in the Houses of Parliament. Their plan failed. Today people in Great Britain light bonfires and set off fireworks at home or at big public displays.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-03:6878c55d03e9','A2'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What do people do on Bonfire Night today?',array['They give presents to children.','They go to Parliament.','They have a picnic in the mountains.','They light bonfires and set off fireworks.']::text[],'D','''Today people in Great Britain light bonfires and set off fireworks.''',array['britain','story','history']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-03','Bonfire Night is on 5 November. It remembers an event in 1605. A group of Catholics, led by Guy Fawkes, planned to kill the Protestant king with a bomb in the Houses of Parliament. Their plan failed. Today people in Great Britain light bonfires and set off fireworks at home or at big public displays.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-03:1cc0a8c1d983','A2'::public.cefr_level,'reading','How many countries make up the United Kingdom?',array['two','five','four','three']::text[],'C','England, Scotland, Wales and Northern Ireland.',array['life_in_uk','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-03','The United Kingdom is made up of four countries: England, Scotland, Wales and Northern Ireland. Their capital cities are London, Edinburgh, Cardiff and Belfast. ''Great Britain'' is the name for England, Scotland and Wales together. Northern Ireland is on the island of Ireland.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-03:37b32da9d6d5','A2'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What is the capital city of Scotland?',array['Belfast','Glasgow','Cardiff','Edinburgh']::text[],'D','The capitals are London, Edinburgh, Cardiff and Belfast.',array['life_in_uk','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-03','The United Kingdom is made up of four countries: England, Scotland, Wales and Northern Ireland. Their capital cities are London, Edinburgh, Cardiff and Belfast. ''Great Britain'' is the name for England, Scotland and Wales together. Northern Ireland is on the island of Ireland.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-03:83bc8c12b8db','A2'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Which country is NOT part of Great Britain?',array['Scotland','England','Wales','Northern Ireland']::text[],'D','Great Britain = England, Scotland and Wales.',array['life_in_uk','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-03','The United Kingdom is made up of four countries: England, Scotland, Wales and Northern Ireland. Their capital cities are London, Edinburgh, Cardiff and Belfast. ''Great Britain'' is the name for England, Scotland and Wales together. Northern Ireland is on the island of Ireland.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-03:7841de2f6fd4','A2'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Why is Sophie phoning the health centre?',array['to cancel an appointment','to buy medicine','to make an appointment with a doctor','to register at a school']::text[],'C','''I''d like to make an appointment with a doctor.''',array['dialogue','life_in_uk']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-03','Receptionist: Good morning, City Health Centre.
