James: How old do I need to be?
Officer: For UK general elections you must be at least 18.
James: And how often are general elections held?
Officer: At least every five years.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-03:b1b212cc915f','B1'::public.cefr_level,'vocabulary','Bonfire Night, on 5 November, remembers a failed plot in 1605 to ___.',array['burn down London','close the theatres','invade France','blow up the Houses of Parliament']::text[],'D','Guy Fawkes and others planned to blow up Parliament in 1605.',array['life_in_uk','history']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-03',null,null,null,null,'practice'),
